-- Heat Check: paid cards, Lv2 Spicy and Lv3 Hot, served only by the server.
-- Generated by tools/cards.mjs --seed from content/*.json. Do not edit by hand.
-- Run after the migrations. Safe to re-run: existing cards are updated in place.

on conflict (game, text) do update set heat = excluded.heat, is_taste = excluded.is_taste, extra = excluded.extra, optional_dare = excluded.optional_dare, active = true;
